    "detailed_description": "You're a capybara on the way to the spa. As nature's bro, you help each animal you encounter with whatever problems they may be having.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as a capybara. (World's largest rodent)<br></li><li>You can change the name of every animal NPC you see in game. (Name them after your friends)<br></li><li>Gain Bro Points as you help animal friends. (Collect them all!)<br></li><li>Press F to make capybara noises. (What sounds do a capybara make?)<br></li><li>Different minigames and challenges. (Like the balloon game or perilous platforming)<br></li><li>Multiple achievements. (Including completing the game without running)<br></li><li>Carry butterflies and frogs on your head. (also birds)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You're a capybara on the way to the spa. As nature's bro, you help each animal you encounter with whatever problems they may be having.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as a capybara. (World's largest rodent)<br></li><li>You can change the name of every animal NPC you see in game. (Name them after your friends)<br></li><li>Gain Bro Points as you help animal friends. (Collect them all!)<br></li><li>Press F to make capybara noises. (What sounds do a capybara make?)<br></li><li>Different minigames and challenges. (Like the balloon game or perilous platforming)<br></li><li>Multiple achievements. (Including completing the game without running)<br></li><li>Carry butterflies and frogs on your head. (also birds)</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play as a Capybara and be a bro to your forest friends as you make your way to the spa.",
